assets/diagrams/vipi-architecture.svg:
VIPI package boundaries
The product package vipi, the only part of the wheel, passes an image from the command line through inputs, the scanner, OCR and detection to the report and exit code; the scanner renders SVG files with vipi.svg, and detection also checks an SVG's source text; config, model setup, results, storage and the local decision models are shared. The research tools (workbench, evaluate, ocr_eval, curation, catalog) import vipi; vipi never imports research or Flask.
